"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0041\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you get rid of the, uh, the almond contract document?\", \"oh no wait, I didn't mean to, can you undo that?\", \"ok so, um, what've I got in there about nettle?\", \"right, uh, tick off the second one and… and delete the third one\"], [\"I'm clearing out old paperwork before the week starts and I don't need it anymore, so could you bin the almond contract for me?\", \"Oops, that was a mistake actually, I clicked through too fast. Could you put it back the way it was?\", \"Different thing now, I'm trying to remember what I've been keeping track of, so what's in the vault about nettle?\", \"Great, that jogs my memory. I've actually done the second one, so tick that off, and the third one can go, please delete it.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0042\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what the Gyvidale group's spending comes to, please?\"], [\"hmm, so how much has the, uh, the Gyvidale group spent in total?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0043\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me where the awning report went, please?\", \"Thank you. Could you also tell me when the freediving business is?\"], [\"umm where did the, uh, the awning report go?\", \"ok and, er, the freediving thing, when's that happening?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0044\", \"v\": [[\"had coffee w Maud today, log it pls\", \"Mistry, thx\"], [\"I had coffee with Maud today; would you please log it?\", \"It was Mistry, please.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0045\", \"v\": [[\"umm so I had coffee with Maud Mistry today, can you, uh, log that?\"], [\"I had coffee with Maud Mistry today. Would you mind logging it, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0046\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you pull up the photos in the, uh, Dennoe album?\", \"oh and, um, can you text Yuki the pension portal?\", \"ok well, uh, the Mantua one, where was that taken?\"], [\"Dennoe album pics\", \"text Yuki the pension portal\", \"Mantua one — where taken?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0047\", \"v\": [[\"umm when's the, uh, the cove thing?\", \"ok and what else is on that day?\", \"hmm, and the unicycling class?\", \"right, and who's coming to it?\", \"oh, different thing, when's the, um, Wanaka business?\"], [\"when is the cove\", \"wat else is on that day\", \"and the unicycling class?\", \"whos coming to it\", \"diff thing, when's the Wanaka stuff\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0048\", \"v\": [[\"um, so how many tasks have I got, uh, due this week?\"], [\"how many tasks due this week?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0049\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which tasks I have due this week, please?\"], [\"which tasks have i got due this week\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0050\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you find the, uh, Graskora energy entry in my locker? just the entry, not the password\"], [\"pull up the Graskora energy entry in the locker pls, not the pw just the row\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0051\", \"v\": [[\"ok so, um, what's the actual password for the Graskora energy thing?\", \"oh, uh, note to self: the plumber prefers texts\", \"um, can you list my albums?\", \"wait hang on, what's, uh, what's still on my list?\", \"ok back to the albums, um, how many is that?\", \"and the walks one, can you, uh, show me the photos in it?\"], [\"Could you tell me what the actual password for the Graskora energy account is, please?\", \"Would you please make a note to self: the plumber prefers texts.\", \"Could you list my albums for me, please?\", \"Sorry, before I forget, could you tell me what's still on my list?\", \"Going back to the albums, could you tell me how many there are?\", \"Would you show me the photos in the walks one, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0052\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please add thirteen zloty for wine to the Dennoe trip group? I paid for it.\", \"Would you mind moving the find task to thursday, please?\", \"Could you please remove the rocket note?\", \"Could you tell me when Grolou's birthday is, please?\"], [\"We picked up a bottle on the way back and I covered it, so can you add thirteen zloty for wine to the Dennoe trip group, paid by me?\", \"Totally separate thing, I'm not going to get to it before then anyway, so move the find task to thursday for me.\", \"I'm tidying up my notes and that one's just clutter now, so could you remove the rocket note?\", \"Oh, and I want to get a card sorted in good time, so when is Grolou's birthday again?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0053\", \"v\": [[\"umm which task is, like, roughly a three hour job?\", \"ok and, uh, how many of those are still open?\"], [\"I've got a free afternoon coming up and want to fill it with something meaty, so which task is roughly a three hour job?\", \"Nice, I just want to make sure I'm not picking something already done, so how many of those are still open?\"]]}","ttft_ms":4282,"type":"result","duration_ms":20502,"uuid":"ea3e6aa6-e071-49b7-808b-796c6d409856","ttft_stream_ms":1416,"time_to_request_ms":148,"first_content_frame_ms":1416,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22358770,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278909242.3066,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
